    "name": "clauderic/dnd-kit",
    "descriptionZh": "拖放工具库 dnd-kit 的主仓库：框架无关的 core（@dnd-kit/abstract）、DOM 实现（@dnd-kit/dom）加各框架薄适配，覆盖列表、网格、多容器、虚拟列表等场景。",
    "takeawayZh": "搭一套指针、触摸、键盘都能拖的列表或网格。",
    "noteZh": "仓库右上角是 Star 17.6k、Fork 924、Sponsor，About 里只写一句 The modern toolkit for building drag and drop interfaces，链接指向 dndkit.com。README 的 Features 段把架构讲成三层：framework-agnostic core 的 @dnd-kit/abstract、DOM 实现的 @dnd-kit/dom，再加各框架适配；输入方式列了 Pointer、mouse、touch 和 keyboard sensors，Accessibility 一条写 Keyboard support, sensible default ARIA attributes。文件树里 config/typescript、apps、packages 并列，最近几次提交都在 fix: subscribe to late signal reads in Vue, Solid, and Svelte，最新 release 是 @dnd-kit/collision@0.5.0。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
